TerricHead: {
	Type: Ranged
	Lore: Created by Vul and given to Manman, this armor reaches the highest heights of stealing life. To try to recreate this armor seems impossible. It’s made from brewing in a cauldron no longer found.
	SetBonus: Turns regular arrows into blood arrows, that regenerate your life on hit, and has a blood spell circle on your bows, guns also regenerate you by 1 everytime you reload
	Log: Act I Life steal ranger armor
}

StaffigyHat: {
	Type: Magic
	Lore: Simple armor crafted from the mysterious moth-shaped souls, why can they morph, let alone be turned into armor? It seems like each moth has a different set of attributes, but this armor, it’s perfect...
	SetBonus: Makes your wand charge speed 25% faster!
	Log: Act I Wand, Mage armor
}

HuntrianHelmet: {
	Type: Resource
	Lore: The battle scars on this armor show, the stingers imbue have a shocking amount of poison, which spikes everything around. Sometimes, it’s even a hassle to put on.
	SetBonus: Have an aura that if anything walks in, gets poisoned heavily for 3 minutes, inflicting a dangerous venom that reduces enemies’ defense by 10 as well as damaging them with a constant effect.
	Log: Act I Resource, Insource-Accessory armor
}

BellMasterHood: {
	Lore: Crafted from ancient silk of a fallen kingdom, decorated with bells along the way. I wonder what secrets the fabric itself holds. It’s said to do wonders for the backlines of the army, holding snipers...
	Type: Ranged
	SetBonus: Summons a large bell that hovers and circles around nearby enemies, when it is shot at, it rings and redirects the projectile to the nearest enemy and boosts the damage by 50%!
}

JacklerHat: {
	Lore: A fun costume Veldrin got for his brother, Veldris, to give to Veizal for Christmas as a helping hand since they were low on funds. They both made it together! Veldrin knows that his brother has a huge crush on the woman he lives with so he decided to give his brother something to help out.
	Type: Summoner
	SetBonus: Minions explode into rose petals upon death, which does great damage!
}

RavagingHelmet: {
	Lore: An armor from an old ravaged beast, long stayed and love lived. The horns bear marks that no one person could cause, it has been beaten up for years on end, and it seems you came to give misery upon a creature and wear it for pride.
	Type: Dodge
	SetBonus: Your dash is longer and faster, and if you dash through an enemy a rock will fall on them
}

HeavyMetalHead: {
	Log: Act I Minion summoner armor
	Lore: Fashion for the ginzte people. Once a part of the Illuria, they gained their own sense of fashion to mimic their leader Ginztia, and now everyone wears it. The armor is heavy and weighted, but allows the wind to breeze through when it gets warm.
	Type: Summoner
	SetBonus: You have two gintze guards who sit by your side and attack enemies
}

AstrasilkHead: {
	Log: Act I mage armor
	Lore: Blessed armor from the stars, granting magic capabilities through wands across time under the aurora.
	Type: Magic
	SetBonus: Every 5 hits it rains a falling star that does some great damage!
}

LovestruckMask: {
	Log: Act I summoner guardian armor
	Lore: Blessed armor from the stars, said to never touch the outside of the armor, or else you’ll be forever attracted to it... I wonder how true that is.
	Type: Summoner
	SetBonus: Cheese-touch
}

ShadeWraithHead: {
	Log: Act I decent melee, and attack speed armor
	Type: Defensive
	SetBonus: You gain 30% increased melee damage and movement speed when you drop below 40% health for 5 seconds!
	Lore: An old armor made from granite, Manman made it himself, one of his least favorite works though...
}

CelestiaMoonHelmet: {
	Log: Act I high defensive armor
	Type: Defensive
	SetBonus: You get a green aura around you that covers your body, that reduces the damage of the first hit every 30 seconds, by 50%!
	Lore: One of the gifted armors from Celestia, a goddess that was no longer seen after the first God war, she gave protection and life and legends have it that all of the 7 sins had to try at the same time to take her down, nobody knows where she is today.
}

WinterbornHead: {
	Log: Act I ice magic armor
	Type: Magic
	SetBonus: Gain up to 3 orbiting snowballs that hit enemies and fly around you. They can break, but they regenerate back!
	Lore: A frozen armor carved and sculpted by the great sculptor Lia, nobody knows of her origins anymore but her statues appear everywhere, this is one of many that remain.
}

LeatherHead: {
	Log: Act I general ranged and crit armor
	Type: Ranged
	SetBonus: Makes all your bows have a spell circle around it when they are charging, it enhances arrow speed by 30%!
	Lore: A simple hunter’s armor, used in hunting small animals made by a small tribe called the Veldi, usually made in red. The armor was sold to Manman because it wasn’t so.
}

StoniaHat: {
	SetBonus: Allows you to take no fall damage and increases your mining and fall speed
	Type: Crit
	Lore: Given from the fallen soldier petrified, the Stone golem. This armor is given as a reward for overcoming the first challenge to being in the Witch's Academy. To test your will, to test your learning, you have so much farther to go. Young witches and wizards wear this as a sign of entrance.
}

ForestCoreHead: {
	Log: Act I general resource armor
	SetBonus: Has a bow that shoots arrows that follow, doing equal damage to the weapon you hold.
	Type: Resource
	Lore: An armor full of secrets and mystery, it holds what we know as plant life, and the armor itself photosynthesizes to carry the nutrients to provide the armor its abilities. Manman says this armor was made by a student of Zui's, who no longer is alive, so it holds some sentimental value to her. Apparently, they used to steal spells from others and try to pass it off as her own, but she's gone now aren�t they?
}

CauldrMothHood: {
	SetBonus:
		'''
		For every 5 new cauldron items unlocked, you gain 1 defense and 1 health. 
		You also have a cool pot floating behind you!
		'''
	Type: Defensive
	Lore: An armor for Ereshkigal's follows as she was rising to Siegfried's side. Crafted to be a sort of fashion, or appreciation and to keep protection, it would be worn by those who would be protecting her during wars. Unfortuantely, it was never used, the war came too fast...
}

IllikenHelmet: {
	SetBonus: After rolling, release a damaging icy burst and gain a burst of damage of 10% for a second!
	Type: Resource
	Lore: Armor crafted by the heaviest of hands, but fragile souls, a touch from a hammer and it could break. Blacksmiths, Mages, and Glassblowers united crafted an armor that could provide extra space within its hull. As during the building times of the Royal Capital Sector, this armor was supposed to carry more supplies to Verlia.
}

DaediaMask: {
	Log: Act I summoner armor
	SetBonus: Summons a few flying moths to circle around you and attack nearby enemies
	Type: Summoner
	Lore: It represents a lazy goddess somewhere far away, its ties are endless and it resembles its form similar to even those who exist on this world, having the same sigil on its back that the Alca family own. Are they descendents of this Sin of Sloth?
}

SetBonus: Set Bonus: {0}
